#34000
The Prismatic Threshold~
The stone throat of the earth opens into a grotto crowded with
translucent crystal. @CBlue@n, @Yamber@n, and @Mviolet@n fire crawls
through the mineral growths whenever the cavern breathes, scattering
restless bands across the damp floor. A broad amber glow to the east
offers the safest path deeper within.
~
