#34001
The Refraction Gallery~
A natural arcade of quartz blades rises from floor to ceiling, each
facet splitting the grotto's pale light into narrow ribbons. Tiny
glasswing tracks glitter in the mineral dust, and old chips in the
crystal show where travelers once tested false seams. The amber route
continues between the brightest formations.
~
